      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd very much enjoy this feature myself. I'd like it if it used the VRChat UI color schemes you can customize when you own VRC+ at least; it would make things more consistent with the other menus. Heck, even the quick menu follows the UI colors, but not the Action Menu? The laser even gets colored! Why not the Action Menu???? If I wanted my main menu to be shades of red, the Action Menu would be out of place and inconsistent. \n\nIn short, please allow the Action Menu (or the OP referred to as the Radial Menu) to be colored and/or customized.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-30T00:45:20.091Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi the radial menu on VRCHAT is default blue/green type of color while being see through a little? I will add a photo of the radial.. I was wondering if we could add the ability to change the color. Nothing else is needed, Im not asking for anything extra, Would it be possible to just change the color. I think other changes may force vrchat to spend more money or do a lot of work but just adding the ability to change the color is something even I could make happen. It can be input in the game very fast and easily and tested without problem! It is my favorite addition from gesture manager. Thank you <3",
